iorities.</p>\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- ===== Contact & Booking Section ===== -->\r\n<section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-800 text-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold\"><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/contact-us/\">Contact Us for a Fast Repair or a <b>Free Estimate!</b></a></h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 mt-2\">Ready to get your appliance working like new? Reach out now!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start\">\r\n<div class=\"space-y-6\">\r\n<div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Call Us Directly</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-300\">For the quickest response, call our <b>washing machine repair phone number</b>:</p>\r\n<a class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-green-400 hover:text-green-300 transition duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 mt-2\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\"> <i class=\"fas fa-phone-volume\"></i> +91-9727257141 </a></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\">Email Us</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-300\">You can also reach us at:</p>\r\n<a class=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 mt-2\" href=\"mailto:atlasaircon1@gmail.com\"> <i class=\"fas fa-envelope\"></i> atlasaircon1@gmail.com </a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white text-gray-800 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-2xl\"><form action=\"#\" method=\"POST\">\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"block text-sm font-bold mb-2\" for=\"name\">Name</label> <input id=\"name\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\" name=\"name\" required=\"\" type=\"text\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"block text-sm font-bold mb-2\" for=\"phone\">Phone Number</label> <input id=\"phone\" class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-30